# The units' standard layouts, replayed through the simulator.
#
#   mechcore run tests/units/regressions.mcscript
#
# This needs no game. The hashes are what the game recorded with
# `record.mcscript`, and the simulator reproduces each fight tick for tick,
# physics and content, from the layout and the seed alone. A fight the
# simulator does not reproduce yet is recorded but not pinned here; the
# README says where each one parts.

